# What this repo takes from ANTfrastructure. One row per asset: the id from
# third_party/ANTfrastructure/shared/config/shared-assets.manifest.
#
# EMPTY BY DESIGN: this repo has no ANTfrastructure submodule and copies none of
# the shared configs or bootstrap templates. The explicit empty manifest is the
# declaration; the drift gate fails on a MISSING manifest rather than skipping,
# because "forgot to declare" and "declares nothing" cannot be told apart from
# an absent file.
